WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:15.730
"What are cave vipers?"

2
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:16.931
Loro asked.

3
00:00:17.491 --> 00:00:18.812
Raff's face was pale.

4
00:00:18.832 --> 00:00:21.694
"Cave vipers are deadly.

5
00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:26.518
And they're immune from magic—that's why they didn't show up on the map."

6
00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:28.660
Zella frowned.

7
00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:33.726
"I wonder if they got down in the hole on their own, or if this is a trap

8
00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:35.726
to keep people from exploring the cave."

9
00:00:35.746 --> 00:00:41.749
"I doubt those vipers have been down there since King Zanta's time," Raff said.

10
00:00:42.069 --> 00:00:46.451
Just then a burst of magic energy rushed toward them from across the hole.

11
00:00:46.471 --> 00:00:48.792
"Did you feel that?"

12
00:00:49.212 --> 00:00:49.692
Raff said.

13
00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:53.574
"Something is giving off strong magic energy."

14
00:00:53.594 --> 00:00:56.215
"Maybe it's the Sovereign's Staff!"

15
00:00:56.575 --> 00:00:57.115
Zella said.

16
00:00:57.135 --> 00:00:59.176
"We should get over to that side!"

17
00:01:00.296 --> 00:01:01.937
"How?" Loro said.

18
00:01:01.957 --> 00:01:04.898
"The hole is too big to jump over."

19
00:01:04.918 --> 00:01:08.159
"Let's levitate over it," Zella said.

20
00:01:08.179 --> 00:01:10.060
"Are you serious?"

21
00:01:11.001 --> 00:01:12.441
Loro looked horrified.

22
00:01:12.461 --> 00:01:15.622
"Our magic is so weak down here.

23
00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.284
We could fall into that hole!"

24
00:01:18.304 --> 00:01:22.885
"He's right—it's too dangerous," Raff said.

25
00:01:22.905 --> 00:01:25.947
"Especially if Zanta did use this cave.

26
00:01:26.627 --> 00:01:28.668
There could be lots of other relics down here."

27
00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.181
Zella narrowed her eyes.

28
00:01:31.201 --> 00:01:35.262
"I thought you didn't believe it was really the Sovereign's Staff."

29
00:01:36.403 --> 00:01:37.143
Raff shrugged.

30
00:01:38.244 --> 00:01:39.624
"Who knows what it is?

31
00:01:40.725 --> 00:01:43.406
But what if this cave is like the Cave of the Unknown?

32
00:01:44.126 --> 00:01:47.608
You told me your heroes weren't supposed to use magic inside that cave.

33
00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:50.289
It was too dangerous."

34
00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:54.931
"This isn't the Cave of the Unknown," Zella snapped.

35
00:01:55.631 --> 00:01:57.612
But she didn't suggest levitating again.

36
00:01:58.856 --> 00:02:00.317
Instead she turned around.

37
00:02:00.337 --> 00:02:01.998
"Let's keep exploring.

38
00:02:02.698 --> 00:02:04.779
Maybe there's a way over there through a different tunnel."

39
00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.021
"This is bad," Queen Venna said.

40
00:02:08.041 --> 00:02:10.722
"It's very, very bad."

41
00:02:11.443 --> 00:02:13.804
She and the others were gathered in the throne room now.

42
00:02:15.045 --> 00:02:16.886
Boz rubbed his long nose.

43
00:02:16.906 --> 00:02:22.329
"We should have destroyed all of the dangerous relics when we had the chance.

44
00:02:23.289 --> 00:02:28.092
The Mask of Zanta holds an unimaginable amount of dark magic energy.

45
00:02:28.872 --> 00:02:34.995
If someone with bad intentions puts it back together, it could give them immense power!"

46
00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:38.957
Zann winced as the queen glared at his grandfather.

47
00:02:38.977 --> 00:02:40.817
"What are we going to do?"

48
00:02:41.238 --> 00:02:43.879
he asked before the two of them started arguing again.

49
00:02:45.019 --> 00:02:46.240
Zann's father shrugged.

50
00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.961
"There's only one thing we can do.

51
00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:53.343
We have to find those pieces of the mask before someone puts them back together."

52
00:02:54.964 --> 00:02:55.744
Zann shivered.

53
00:02:56.672 --> 00:02:58.934
He remembered holding the Mask of Zanta.

54
00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:04.077
The mask had recognized that Zann was a descendant of King Zanta.

55
00:03:04.938 --> 00:03:08.860
It had flooded Zann with a terrifying amount of powerful energy.

56
00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:14.144
"We should also investigate the report about the Sovereign's Staff," Zann's mother added.

57
00:03:14.164 --> 00:03:17.466
"If it has turned up, we'll need to do something."

58
00:03:17.486 --> 00:03:19.127
"I know."

59
00:03:20.728 --> 00:03:21.689
Queen Venna sighed.

60
00:03:21.709 --> 00:03:25.792
"That relic has unimaginable dark magic energy too."

61
00:03:26.764 --> 00:03:28.405
"I want to help," Perda said.

62
00:03:29.706 --> 00:03:32.628
Zann expected the adults to say no, as usual.

63
00:03:33.569 --> 00:03:36.551
Instead they almost seemed to welcome Perda's offer.

64
00:03:36.571 --> 00:03:39.853
"It's up to your parents, Perda," Queen Venna said.

65
00:03:39.873 --> 00:03:43.696
"But if they say yes, we'd be glad to have your help.

66
00:03:44.516 --> 00:03:45.497
Yours too, Zann."

67
00:03:46.498 --> 00:03:47.618
Zann's mother nodded.

68
00:03:47.638 --> 00:03:51.721
"You kids have proven yourselves to be strong and clever.

69
00:03:52.141 --> 00:03:54.263
And we're going to need all the help we can get."

70
00:03:54.863 --> 00:03:55.684
Boz nodded.

71
00:03:56.384 --> 00:03:57.785
"Gather what you need, everyone.

72
00:03:58.826 --> 00:04:01.708
We depart for Mount Mystery in the morning."

73
00:04:02.849 --> 00:04:04.830
Raff was looking around a new chamber.

74
00:04:05.651 --> 00:04:07.432
He glanced up at his sister's cry.

75
00:04:07.452 --> 00:04:09.154
"Look over here!"

76
00:04:09.534 --> 00:04:10.175
Zella shouted.

77
00:04:10.195 --> 00:04:11.616
"What is it?"

78
00:04:11.956 --> 00:04:12.556
Raff asked.

79
00:04:12.576 --> 00:04:14.538
"I found another tunnel!"

80
00:04:14.938 --> 00:04:16.159
Zella sounded excited.

81
00:04:16.179 --> 00:04:19.762
"It looks like it's leading toward the spot where we felt the magic energy."

82
00:04:19.782 --> 00:04:21.343
"Are you sure?"

83
00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:23.280
Loro asked.

84
00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.581
"We've been wandering around so much that I've lost my sense of direction."

85
00:04:27.281 --> 00:04:28.021
Zella nodded.

86
00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:31.282
"It was hidden by a weak Invisible Shield spell.

87
00:04:32.122 --> 00:04:35.183
When I did a Clearing spell, it disappeared completely."

88
00:04:36.003 --> 00:04:37.224
Loro went over to her.

89
00:04:37.244 --> 00:04:39.044
"Be careful.

90
00:04:40.065 --> 00:04:44.446
If that tunnel had a spell hiding it, there could be something dangerous in there."

91
00:04:44.466 --> 00:04:49.487
"Maybe the Shield spell was weak because it was very old," Raff said.

92
00:04:49.507 --> 00:04:52.568
"It could have been set during the Old Times."

93
00:04:53.836 --> 00:04:56.378
He thought that might make his sister act more carefully.

94
00:04:57.399 --> 00:04:59.421
Instead, she looked more excited than ever.

95
00:04:59.441 --> 00:05:01.042
"Let's check it out!"

96
00:05:01.803 --> 00:05:02.964
She rushed into the tunnel.

97
00:05:04.165 --> 00:05:07.527
Raff was scared, but he didn't want her to wander off alone.

98
00:05:07.547 --> 00:05:09.829
"Zella! Wait for me!"

99
00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.972
They crept along as the tunnel sloped downward.

100
00:05:14.793 --> 00:05:17.655
Finally they reached an intersection with another tunnel.

101
00:05:17.675 --> 00:05:19.437
"Which way should we go?"

102
00:05:19.797 --> 00:05:20.438
Zella asked.

103
00:05:21.519 --> 00:05:22.920
Just then they heard a shout.

104
00:05:23.552 --> 00:05:26.854
Holding up his light, Raff saw the mayor rushing up behind them.

105
00:05:27.835 --> 00:05:29.075
"Stop right there, you two!

106
00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:31.917
I told you kids to stay away from this cave!"

107
00:05:31.937 --> 00:05:35.119
"S-sorry," Raff stammered.

108
00:05:36.299 --> 00:05:38.560
He looked around for Loro but couldn't see him.

109
00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:41.662
"We were just trying to help," Zella said.

110
00:05:41.682 --> 00:05:45.664
"We wanted to—" "I don't want to hear your excuses!"

111
00:05:46.565 --> 00:05:49.567
Her face red with anger, Mayor Ruxton pointed.

112
00:05:49.587 --> 00:05:52.008
"Outside, now!

113
00:05:52.392 --> 00:05:53.653
And don't come in here again!"

114
00:05:55.014 --> 00:05:57.395
Even Zella didn't dare to argue with her.

115
00:05:58.676 --> 00:06:00.577
Soon the siblings were back outside.

116
00:06:01.497 --> 00:06:03.558
Loro was wandering around the clearing.

117
00:06:03.578 --> 00:06:05.319
"There you are!"

118
00:06:05.639 --> 00:06:06.140
Raff said.

119
00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.341
"How did you get out here?"

120
00:06:08.681 --> 00:06:09.301
Zella asked.

121
00:06:09.321 --> 00:06:13.123
"Sorry." Loro looked sheepish.

122
00:06:13.143 --> 00:06:18.126
"I was feeling claustrophobic, so I came out for some fresh air.

123
00:06:19.307 --> 00:06:22.773
I told you I was turning back, but I guess you didn't hear me."

124
00:06:23.774 --> 00:06:26.536
Zella put her hands on her hips and glared at him.

125
00:06:26.556 --> 00:06:28.937
"Did you tell the mayor we were in there?"

126
00:06:28.957 --> 00:06:30.719
"Of course not!"

127
00:06:31.079 --> 00:06:31.679
Loro said.

128
00:06:31.699 --> 00:06:33.981
"Didn't you get my message moth?

129
00:06:34.862 --> 00:06:36.623
I tried to warn you she was coming."

130
00:06:36.643 --> 00:06:38.664
"Oh!" Zella said.

131
00:06:38.684 --> 00:06:40.866
"Thanks for trying to warn us.

132
00:06:42.007 --> 00:06:44.629
She found us—and now she's furious at us."

133
00:06:45.649 --> 00:06:48.852
Raff nodded and shot a nervous look back at the cave entrance.

134
00:06:49.736 --> 00:06:52.021
"Let's get out of here before she comes back out."
